id: 6ae678-how-payments-work
kind: understand
title: How payments work
created: 2026-01-01T00:00:00Z
cites:
  - path: src/pay/service.ts
    symbol: createPayment()
    blob: "fcef00c9f52f67593b0c2531ece9c0ae0441c617"
  - path: src/pay/
    tree: "108c94b558095fa0a119b07cdf13c701ba43895f"
---

## Summary

Payments start in createPayment().
-- want-commit.txt --
A	lyceum/understand/6ae678-how-payments-work.md
-- want-refresh.txt --
M	lyceum/understand/6ae678-how-payments-work.md
-- want-flow.txt --
A	lyceum/trace/flow.md
-- want-status.txt --
?? scratch.txt
-- no-title.md --
---
kind: trace
cites:
  - path: src/pay/service.ts
---
-- bad-kind.md --
---
kind: notes
title: Request flow
---
-- absent.md --
